---
import SiteLayout from '../layouts/SiteLayout.astro';
---

<SiteLayout
  title="Nocturne Engine"
  description="Nocturne Engine — a custom Windows C++20+ game engine for first-person survival horror."
>
  <section class="hero shell">
    <div class="hero-copy">
      <div class="eyebrow">
        <span class="status-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        NOCTURNE / ENGINE
      </div>
      <h1>Built for the dark.</h1>
      <p class="lede">
        A custom C++ game engine and editor built for a first-person survival horror game,
        with a Windows-first runtime and DirectX 12 renderer.
      </p>

      <div class="actions">
        <a class="button primary" href="/docs">Documentation</a>
        <a class="button" href="/download">Downloads</a>
      </div>

      <div class="tech-line" aria-label="Core technology">
        <span>Windows</span>
        <span>C++20+</span>
        <span>DirectX 12</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="editor-surface" aria-label="Nocturne Engine technical overview">
      <div class="surface-toolbar">
        <span class="surface-title">NOCTURNE</span>
        <span class="surface-state"><i></i> Runtime ready</span>
      </div>
      <div class="surface-body">
        <div class="surface-sidebar">
          <span>SCENE</span>
          <b>Runtime World</b>
          <span>Resources</span>
          <span>Renderer</span>
          <span>Editor</span>
        </div>
        <div class="viewport">
          <div class="viewport-grid"></div>
          <img src="/nocturne-logo.png" alt="" />
          <strong>NOCTURNE ENGINE</strong>
          <small>Runtime · Rendering · Tools</small>
        </div>
        <div class="surface-inspector">
          <span>STATUS</span>
          <dl>
            <div><dt>Runtime</dt><dd>Ready</dd></div>
            <div><dt>Renderer</dt><dd>DX12</dd></div>
            <div><dt>Editor</dt><dd>Active</dd></div>
          </dl>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="surface-status">
        <span><i></i> Ready</span>
        <span>Nocturne Engine</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="capabilities shell" aria-labelledby="capabilities-title">
    <div class="section-heading">
      <span class="eyebrow">CURRENT FOUNDATION</span>
      <h2 id="capabilities-title">One engine. One editor. Explicit systems.</h2>
      <p>
        The site documents the current implementation rather than presenting planned
        roadmap systems as finished features.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="capability-grid">
      <article>
        <span class="index">01</span>
        <h3>Runtime</h3>
        <p>Explicit subsystem lifetime, main-loop ownership and production engineering contracts.</p>
      </article>
      <article>
        <span class="index">02</span>
        <h3>Rendering</h3>
        <p>DirectX 12 renderer foundation with editor viewport integration and GPU resource infrastructure.</p>
      </article>
      <article>
        <span class="index">03</span>
        <h3>Resources</h3>
        <p>Virtual file system, resource management and an asset import/cook pipeline designed for tooling.</p>
      </article>
      <article>
        <span class="index">04</span>
        <h3>Editor</h3>
        <p>A native Windows authoring surface built on the same runtime rather than a second engine.</p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="docs-cta shell">
    <div>
      <span class="eyebrow">DOCUMENTATION</span>
      <h2>Architecture that stays inspectable.</h2>
      <p>
        Read the architectural contract, implementation history, production engineering
        standard and current system documentation from one searchable surface.
      </p>
    </div>
    <a class="button primary" href="/docs">Open documentation →</a>
  </section>
</SiteLayout>

<style>
  .shell {
    width: min(1180px, calc(100% - 2rem));
    margin-inline: auto;
  }

  .hero {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 0.9fr) minmax(480px, 1.1fr);
    align-items: center;
    gap: clamp(2rem, 6vw, 6rem);
    padding-block: clamp(4.5rem, 9vw, 8rem);
  }

  .eyebrow {
    color: var(--noc-text-muted);
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.14em;
  }

  .status-dot {
    display: inline-block;
    width: 0.46rem;
    height: 0.46rem;
    margin-right: 0.45rem;
    border-radius: 999px;
    background: var(--noc-accent);
    box-shadow: 0 0 16px color-mix(in srgb, var(--noc-accent) 60%, transparent);
  }

  h1 {
    margin: 0.8rem 0 1rem;
    font-family: var(--noc-font-display);
    font-size: clamp(3.4rem, 7vw, 6.4rem);
    line-height: 0.94;
    letter-spacing: -0.055em;
  }

  .lede {
    max-width: 42rem;
    color: var(--noc-text-muted);
    font-size: clamp(1rem, 1.8vw, 1.17rem);
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  .actions {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.65rem;
    margin-top: 1.6rem;
  }

  .button {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    min-height: 2.55rem;
    padding: 0 1rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--noc-border);
    border-radius: var(--noc-radius-md);
    background: var(--noc-button-bg);
    color: var(--noc-text-primary);
    text-decoration: none;
    font-size: 0.84rem;
    font-weight: 650;
  }

  .button:hover {
    border-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--noc-border) 55%, var(--noc-text-muted));
    background: var(--noc-button-hover);
  }

  .button.primary {
    border-color: var(--noc-accent);
    background: var(--noc-accent);
    color: #f7fbff;
  }

  .button.primary:hover {
    border-color: var(--noc-accent-hover);
    background: var(--noc-accent-hover);
  }

  .tech-line {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.45rem;
    margin-top: 1.35rem;
  }

  .tech-line span {
    padding: 0.3rem 0.5rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--noc-border);
    border-radius: 4px;
    background: var(--noc-input-bg);
    color: var(--noc-text-muted);
    font-family: var(--noc-font-mono);
    font-size: 0.72rem;
  }

  .editor-surface {
    overflow: hidden;
    border: 1px solid var(--noc-border);
    border-radius: 8px;
    background: var(--noc-panel-bg);
    box-shadow: 0 30px 90px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.34);
  }

  .surface-toolbar,
  .surface-status {
    min-height: 2.1rem;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 1rem;
    padding-inline: 0.75rem;
    background: var(--noc-toolbar-bg);
    color: var(--noc-text-muted);
    font-size: 0.66rem;
  }

  .surface-toolbar {
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--noc-border);
  }

  .surface-status {
    border-top: 1px solid var(--noc-border);
  }

  .surface-title {
    color: var(--noc-text-primary);
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.11em;
  }

  .surface-state i,
  .surface-status i {
    display: inline-block;
    width: 0.42rem;
    height: 0.42rem;
    margin-right: 0.32rem;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--noc-success);
  }

  .surface-body {
    min-height: 330px;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 108px 1fr 124px;
    gap: 1px;
    background: var(--noc-border);
  }

  .surface-sidebar,
  .surface-inspector {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.65rem;
    padding: 0.8rem;
    background: var(--noc-panel-bg);
    color: var(--noc-text-muted);
    font-size: 0.62rem;
  }

  .surface-sidebar > span:first-child,
  .surface-inspector > span:first-child {
    color: var(--noc-text-muted);
    font-size: 0.57rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
  }

  .surface-sidebar b {
    color: var(--noc-text-primary);
    font-size: 0.65rem;
  }

  .viewport {
    position: relative;
    display: grid;
    place-items: center;
    align-content: center;
    overflow: hidden;
    min-width: 0;
    background:
      radial-gradient(circle at 50% 38%, rgba(25, 132, 236, 0.09), transparent 9rem),
      var(--noc-viewport-bg);
  }

  .viewport-grid {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 45% -30% -50%;
    opacity: 0.45;
    transform: perspective(360px) rotateX(62deg);
    transform-origin: top;
    background-image:
      linear-gradient(var(--noc-border) 1px, transparent 1px),
      linear-gradient(90deg, var(--noc-border) 1px, transparent 1px);
    background-size: 30px 30px;
  }

  .viewport img {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
    width: 54px;
    height: 54px;
    object-fit: contain;
    opacity: 0.82;
  }

  .viewport strong,
  .viewport small {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
  }

  .viewport strong {
    margin-top: 0.7rem;
    font-family: var(--noc-font-display);
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
  }

  .viewport small {
    margin-top: 0.35rem;
    color: var(--noc-text-muted);
    font-size: 0.62rem;
  }

  dl,
  dl div {
    margin: 0;
  }

  dl div {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 0.6rem;
    padding-block: 0.42rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--noc-border);
  }

  dt,
  dd {
    margin: 0;
  }

  dd {
    color: var(--noc-text-primary);
  }

  .capabilities {
    padding-block: 2rem 6rem;
  }

  .section-heading {
    max-width: 46rem;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }

  .section-heading h2,
  .docs-cta h2 {
    margin: 0.55rem 0 0.7rem;
    font-family: var(--noc-font-display);
    font-size: clamp(1.9rem, 4vw, 3rem);
    letter-spacing: -0.035em;
  }

  .section-heading p,
  .docs-cta p {
    color: var(--noc-text-muted);
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  .capability-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
    gap: var(--noc-panel-gap);
  }

  .capability-grid article {
    min-height: 165px;
    padding: 1rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--noc-border);
    border-radius: var(--noc-radius-md);
    background: var(--noc-panel-bg);
  }

  .index {
    color: var(--noc-accent);
    font-family: var(--noc-font-mono);
    font-size: 0.7rem;
  }

  .capability-grid h3 {
    margin: 1.8rem 0 0.5rem;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
  }

  .capability-grid p {
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--noc-text-muted);
    font-size: 0.82rem;
    line-height: 1.65;
  }

  .docs-cta {
    display: flex;
    align-items: end;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 2rem;
    margin-bottom: 5rem;
    padding: clamp(1.4rem, 4vw, 2.4rem);
    border: 1px solid var(--noc-border);
    border-radius: 8px;
    background:
      linear-gradient(120deg, rgba(25, 132, 236, 0.08), transparent 42%),
      var(--noc-panel-bg);
  }

  .docs-cta > div {
    max-width: 45rem;
  }

  @media (max-width: 940px) {
    .hero {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .capability-grid {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 620px) {
    .hero {
      padding-top: 3.25rem;
    }

    .surface-body {
      grid-template-columns: 82px 1fr;
    }

    .surface-inspector {
      display: none;
    }

    .capability-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .docs-cta {
      align-items: start;
      flex-direction: column;
    }
  }
</style>
